{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A RAW MATERIAL AS JSON (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The price of a material comes from its "Price factor": a standard or plus material adds a percentage (1.05 is +5%),
a premium one multiplies the price (2 is × 2). The rug page and the price guide of "Tailor your rug" both read the
materials through this snippet, so they price a material the same way.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* material: the "rug_material" entry (required)
* card: true to add the colour card of the material, as "palette"
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign material_percent = 0
  assign material_times = 100
  assign material_premium = false

  if material.group.value == 'Premium'
    assign material_times = material.factor.value | default: 1 | times: 100 | round
    assign material_premium = true
  else
    assign material_percent = material.factor.value | default: 1 | times: 100 | round | minus: 100
  endif
-%}

{"handle":{{ material.system.handle | json }},"name":{{ material.name.value | json }},"note":{{ material.supplement.value | default: '' | json }},"percent":{{ material_percent }},"times":{{ material_times }},"premium":{{ material_premium }}{% if card %},"palette":[{% render 'rug-palette', lines: material.colours.value %}]{% endif %}}
